# The trust-region solver from the guess (MaxIter 1), with analytic
# Hessian-vector products including the XC response; it reaches the
# energy of complex_orbs_n2_b3lyp.
System N2.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
Method hyb_gga_xc_b3lyp
Multiplicity 1
Restricted true
ComplexBasis true
JKMethod Cholesky
DFTGrid 75 -302
ConvThr 1e-8
MaxIter 1
TrustRegion true
SaveChk complex_orbs_n2_b3lyp_tr.chk
